      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-12-13",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - The Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of general debate on H.R. 1147.",
      "time": "13:56:29",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
    {
      "action_code": "H32400",
      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-12-13",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Scott DesJarlais to act as Chairman of the Committee.",
      "time": "13:56:22",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
    {
      "action_code": "H32020",
      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-12-13",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 922 and Rule XVIII.",
      "time": "13:56:21",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
    {
      "action_code": "H8D000",
      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-12-13",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1147 and H.R. 357. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 1147 under a structured rule with one hour of general debate and H.R. 357 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate. The resolution provides for a motion to recommit on both measures. It also provides that on any legislative day of the second session of the 118th Congress before January 9, 2024, the Speaker may dispense with organizational and legislative business and that the Journal of the proceedings of the previous day shall be considered as approved if applicable.",
      "time": "13:55:38",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
    {
      "action_code": "H30000",
      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-12-13",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 922. (consideration: CR H6889-6907; text of amendment in the nature of a substitute: CR H6903)",
      "time": "13:55:33",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
    {
      "action_code": "H1L210",
      "committees": null,
      "date": "2023-12-11",
      "rollcall_id": null,
      "source_system": "House floor actions",
      "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 922 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1147 and H.R. 357. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 1147 under a structured rule with one hour of general debate and H.R. 357 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate. The resolution provides for a motion to recommit on both measures. It also provides that on any legislative day of the second session of the 118th Congress before January 9, 2024, the Speaker may dispense with organizational and legislative business and that the Journal of the proceedings of the previous day shall be considered as approved if applicable.",
      "time": "20:11:22",
      "type": "Floor"
    },
